      <note type="generalNote">
        <p>The Varsity Men's Swimming team was recognized in 1933 under head coach Art Adamson. Women's Swimming became a varsity team in 1971 under head coach Dennis Fosdick. The diving team began competing in 1947 under Emil Mamaliga. After its resurrection in 1991, however, it was under the instruction of Mel Nash. The Aggies won their first Southwest Conference title in the 1944-1945 season. The men acquired 3 Conference titles between their recognition as a varsity sport and the year 2006. The women won the Big 12 Championships in 2007, giving them their only conference title between the years 1983 and 2008.</p>
      </note>
