    <scopecontent encodinganalog="3.3.1">
      <p>This collection includes media guides from both men and women's aquatic sports. The majority are specifically for swimming and diving, but some include details about water polo. The media guides contain statistics, schedules, and the Texas A&amp;M roster for each season.</p>
    </scopecontent>
    <arrangement encodinganalog="3.3.4">
